   "gameId": "vanity-fair-the-pursuit-308113",
   "displayName": "Best rewards. Major update: multilingual version launched",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-04-26T05:03:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Update content",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "1. Mainly optimized for compatibility issues with A card",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. A multilingual trial version has been updated, without any updates to the storyline content. It only replaces the video without subtitles and cheats multilingual subtitle files. Due to translation cost limitations, we have adopted Chat Gpt for translation in multiple languages, which may result in inaccurate translations. The production team will optimize the translation based on their own foreign language learning situation in the future.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. The list of production personnel thanks the first batch of players who participated in the second creation (it is your participation that gave us greater confidence! Thank you for coming and giving us the warmest beam of light in the long night!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
